{"4228450":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Corner Arcade","steam_appid":4228450,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corner Arcade is an idle management sim, in which you get to build and run your own arcade empire, while having the freedom to unwind with a movie, catch up on some work, hang out with friends or even just be immersed in the buzz of your own arcade. Whether you’ve got the corner of a screen free, or a whole second monitor to spare, we’ve got you covered. Whether you want to stretch the definition of multi-tasking, or just feel like unwinding with the company of your arcade, Corner Arcade is waiting for you. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/7cf79db363284ebc40051f03389e7b16.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/7cf79db363284ebc40051f03389e7b16.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/7cf79db363284ebc40051f03389e7b16.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Build your arcade:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Corner Arcade, you build your arcade, your way. Fancy a wild arcade jungle where you swing from one game to another; make it so. Feel like a more structured arcade with curated zones, so gamers can find their games and make camp; go for it.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfd461751353b6f87c5b44327ecaf29c.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfd461751353b6f87c5b44327ecaf29c.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfd461751353b6f87c5b44327ecaf29c.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><strong>Arcade Machines:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of any arcade is of course the games! Buy, upgrade and research arcade machines that will attract the best guests to your arcade! From classic arcade games in retro cabinets to beat-thumping dance machines to work up a sweat, from good ol’ skeeball machines for those with a skilled hand to huge LAN desks, where parties can game the night away, and so much more. Corner Arcade gives you the options to run the arcade you want!  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/3fe20edea6331cd71b21712e79c9bfd0.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/3fe20edea6331cd71b21712e79c9bfd0.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/3fe20edea6331cd71b21712e79c9bfd0.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fine tuning those upgrades:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you own a machine the fun does not stop there. Now you can tinker and upgrade it to help bring you in more quarters, more quickly. You can increase the quarters per play or decrease the play time, or both! Upgrade it to store more quarters, so you can be less hands on, and add more duct tape to keep it running longer! And don’t forget to upgrade the contents of the game to draw in the best gamers around! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/287c6107774d7f6b26b8ee63a2da879e.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/287c6107774d7f6b26b8ee63a2da879e.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/287c6107774d7f6b26b8ee63a2da879e.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIPs in the house!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While all gamers are welcome, some are more welcome than others. It’s not just about those who shower, though hygienic visitors are always preferred! Some gamers have deeper pockets, will play longer, and set higher scores, and they are worth their weight in quarters, if you can draw them in of course! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/f5a4f4768881f398daad457b2a6bb29f.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/f5a4f4768881f398daad457b2a6bb29f.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/f5a4f4768881f398daad457b2a6bb29f.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some work required:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While it’s not all fun and games, you have to keep the arcade running, and those quarters won’t empty themselves… at least not yet. But if you keep expanding your arcade, and researching away, who knows what you might unlock… <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/bcd6c517752d0f5637eb50d2c4cab570.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/bcd6c517752d0f5637eb50d2c4cab570.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/bcd6c517752d0f5637eb50d2c4cab570.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arcade Life:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t forget to kickback and soak in the buzz of the arcade from time to time. You built the arcade, you may as well watch people enjoying it! Also why stop at just one arcade, this game was built for the multi-taskers, “If one is good, then more must be better!”, right…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfc233fee957596c42d3bfb6849a6003.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfc233fee957596c42d3bfb6849a6003.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfc233fee957596c42d3bfb6849a6003.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corner Arcade is an idle management sim, in which you get to build and run your own arcade empire, while having the freedom to unwind with a movie, catch up on some work, hang out with friends or even just be immersed in the buzz of your own arcade. Whether you’ve got the corner of a screen free, or a whole second monitor to spare, we’ve got you covered. Whether you want to stretch the definition of multi-tasking, or just feel like unwinding with the company of your arcade, Corner Arcade is waiting for you. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/7cf79db363284ebc40051f03389e7b16.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/7cf79db363284ebc40051f03389e7b16.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/7cf79db363284ebc40051f03389e7b16.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Build your arcade:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Corner Arcade, you build your arcade, your way. Fancy a wild arcade jungle where you swing from one game to another; make it so. Feel like a more structured arcade with curated zones, so gamers can find their games and make camp; go for it.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfd461751353b6f87c5b44327ecaf29c.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfd461751353b6f87c5b44327ecaf29c.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfd461751353b6f87c5b44327ecaf29c.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><strong>Arcade Machines:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the core of any arcade is of course the games! Buy, upgrade and research arcade machines that will attract the best guests to your arcade! From classic arcade games in retro cabinets to beat-thumping dance machines to work up a sweat, from good ol’ skeeball machines for those with a skilled hand to huge LAN desks, where parties can game the night away, and so much more. Corner Arcade gives you the options to run the arcade you want!  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/3fe20edea6331cd71b21712e79c9bfd0.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/3fe20edea6331cd71b21712e79c9bfd0.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/3fe20edea6331cd71b21712e79c9bfd0.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fine tuning those upgrades:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you own a machine the fun does not stop there. Now you can tinker and upgrade it to help bring you in more quarters, more quickly. You can increase the quarters per play or decrease the play time, or both! Upgrade it to store more quarters, so you can be less hands on, and add more duct tape to keep it running longer! And don’t forget to upgrade the contents of the game to draw in the best gamers around! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/287c6107774d7f6b26b8ee63a2da879e.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/287c6107774d7f6b26b8ee63a2da879e.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/287c6107774d7f6b26b8ee63a2da879e.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIPs in the house!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While all gamers are welcome, some are more welcome than others. It’s not just about those who shower, though hygienic visitors are always preferred! Some gamers have deeper pockets, will play longer, and set higher scores, and they are worth their weight in quarters, if you can draw them in of course! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/f5a4f4768881f398daad457b2a6bb29f.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/f5a4f4768881f398daad457b2a6bb29f.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/f5a4f4768881f398daad457b2a6bb29f.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Some work required:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While it’s not all fun and games, you have to keep the arcade running, and those quarters won’t empty themselves… at least not yet. But if you keep expanding your arcade, and researching away, who knows what you might unlock… <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/bcd6c517752d0f5637eb50d2c4cab570.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/bcd6c517752d0f5637eb50d2c4cab570.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/bcd6c517752d0f5637eb50d2c4cab570.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arcade Life:<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t forget to kickback and soak in the buzz of the arcade from time to time. You built the arcade, you may as well watch people enjoying it! Also why stop at just one arcade, this game was built for the multi-taskers, “If one is good, then more must be better!”, right…<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfc233fee957596c42d3bfb6849a6003.poster.avif?t=1793645417\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfc233fee957596c42d3bfb6849a6003.webm?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4228450\/extras\/dfc233fee957596c42d3bfb6849a6003.mp4?t=1793645417\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Live the dream and run your own arcade in this idle management sim. Purchase arcade machines and build your space, your way. Run your arcade, level up and upgrade your machines to attract elite gamers and watch as they empty their pockets to fill yours! Then sit back &amp; enjoy the buzz of the arcade.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamsta